OL,3,AThree sisters who died in sea off
OL,4,ABrighton took own lives, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree sisters whose bodies were pulled
OL,7,Ffrom the sea off Brighton took their
OL,8,Fown lives, a coroner has ruled.
OL,10,FJane Adetoro, 36, Christina Walters,
OL,11,F32, and Rebecca Walters, 31, who had
OL,12,Fall been living together in Greenford,
OL,13,FLondon, died on 13 May.
OL,15,FTwo days before they drowned, the
OL,16,Fsisters had visited an area of
OL,17,FBirmingham close to where their mother
OL,18,Fhad drowned in a lake a few years
OL,19,Fearlier. They then travelled to
OL,20,FBrighton.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
