OL,3,AThree sisters who died in sea off
OL,4,ABrighton took own lives, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior coroner Penelope Schofield said
OL,7,Fthe women faced adverse sea conditions
OL,8,Fwhen they entered the water off
OL,9,FBrighton beach and could not swim.
